  "targetText": "Positive real L² operators: equality from equal squaresAttributed ASTIS completion of positive REAL scalar-root uniqueness background for Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang. This is not the printed joint ΓP transport/B.11 identity or a main theorem.arXiv:2609.06905v1; Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib · arXiv2609.06905v1 D1 positive-root uniqueness background; scalar antecedent to printed B10 canonical joint root · faithful paraphraseComplete source statement (Samplinglib restatement)Let Ω be any measurable space, μ any measure, and A,B bounded positive real-linear operators on L²(μ;ℝ). Assume A²=B², where multiplication is composition. Then A=B. Positivity is symmetry plus nonnegative quadratic form on the complete real L² space. No finite/probability measure, finite-dimensiona",
